{57}{The magickal college of force deals with drawing upon the natural energies that surround us.  Through extreme concentration and sheer volition, you learn to draw this energy into yourself, shape it to your will, and then dispense it to do your bidding.  It is an extremely powerful magick.}{The magickal college of force deals with drawing upon the natural energies that surround us.  Through extreme concentration and sheer volition, you learn to draw this energy into yourself, shape it to your will, and then dispense it to do your bidding.  It is an extremely powerful magick.}{}{}{}{lf2 1}
